msgid "Important Information"
msgstr "Önemli Bilgi"

#: R/multisurvival.b.R
msgid "Important Notes:"
msgstr "Önemli Notlar:"

#: R/oddsratio.b.R
msgid "Important:"
msgstr "Önemli:"

#: R/oddsratio.b.R
msgid "Important: Please Verify These Interpretations"
msgstr "Önemli: Lütfen Bu Yorumları Doğrulayın"

#: R/survival.b.R
msgid ""
"In the {group} group the median was not reached: fewer than half of the "
"patients had the event during the observed follow-up. This may reflect "
"genuinely long survival, but short follow-up or heavy censoring produces the "
"same result, so it should be read together with the number at risk over time."
msgstr ""
