#: R/multisurvival.b.R
msgid ""
"with only focal \\u{00D7} moderator in the model, they differ only because "
"the interaction model uses a common baseline hazard across moderator levels "
"while a subgroup-only fit uses a moderator-specific baseline (Cox's risk "
"sets differ)."
msgstr ""
"modelde yalnızca odak \\\\u{00D7} moderatör varken, fark yalnızca etkileşim "
